nancial centers and Japan turned down. However, liabilities to \\\"all other countries\\\" have continued to grow at a steady pace in the post crisis years. In the first three quarters of 2013, liabilities to most regions increased, especially those to the United Kingdom. The only region to which there was a decline in liabilities was \\\"all other Asia\\\".\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 5, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [144, 1992, 301, 2018], \"page_id\": 73}], \"content\": \"December 2013\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 6, \"type\": \"page_footer\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [667, 92, 969, 127], \"page_id\": 74}], \"content\": \"CAPITAL MOVEMENTS\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"page_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1455, 94, 1490, 130], \"page_id\": 74}], \"content\": \"69\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 1, \"type\": \"page_number\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [193, 193, 1435, 243], \"page_id\": 74}], \"content\": \"SECTION II.\\u2014Claims on Foreigners Reported by Banks in the United States\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 2, \"type\": \"title\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [532, 250, 1106, 290], \"page_id\": 74}], \"content\": \"TABLE CM-II-1.\\u2014Total Claims by Type\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 3, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [446, 302, 1186, 330], \"page_id\": 74}], \"content\": \"[Position at end of period in millions of dollars. Source: Treasury International Capital Reporting System]\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 4, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [155, 339, 1475, 1791], \"page_id\": 74}], \"content\": \"<table><tr><th>Type of Claim</th><th>Calendar Year 2011</th><th colspan=\\\"3\\\">2012</th><th colspan=\\\"2\\\">2013</th></tr><tr><th></th><th></th><th>June r</th><th>Sept. r</th><th>Dec. r</th><th>Mar.</th><th>June p</th></tr><tr><td>Total claims</td><td>4,263,195</td><td>3,720,551</td><td>3,875,769</td><td>3,833,788</td><td>3,800,254</td><td>3,660,877</td></tr><tr><