8. Although the lion\\u2019s share of banking claims against the Unites States is held by the international financial centers, this share has fallen while Asia\\u2019s share has grown from under 5 percent in 2008 to over 15 percent in 2012.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 8, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [137, 1989, 304, 2018], \"page_id\": 79}], \"content\": \"December 2013\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 9, \"type\": \"page_footer\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [687, 94, 984, 125], \"page_id\": 80}], \"content\": \"CAPITAL MOVEMENTS\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"page_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1457, 97, 1492, 127], \"page_id\": 80}], \"content\": \"75\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 1, \"type\": \"page_number\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [315, 196, 1342, 316], \"page_id\": 80}], \"content\": \"SECTION III.\\u2014Liabilities to, and Claims on, Unaffiliated Foreigners\\nReported by Nonbanking Business Enterprises\\nin the United States\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 2, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [466, 337, 1197, 384], \"page_id\": 80}], \"content\": \"TABLE CM-III-1.\\u2014Total Liabilities and Claims by Type\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 3, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [459, 387, 1198, 417], \"page_id\": 80}], \"content\": \"[Position at end of period in millions of dollars. Source: Treasury International Capital Reporting System]\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 4, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [153, 420, 1508, 1780], \"page_id\": 80}], \"content\": \"<table><tr><th>Type of liability or claim</th><th colspan=\\\"3\\\">Calendar year</th><th colspan=\\\"3\\\">2012</th><th colspan=\\\"2\\\">2013</th></tr><tr><th></th><th>2009</th><th>2010</th><th>2011</th><th>June</th><th>Sept.</th><th>Dec.</th><th>Mar.</th><th>June p</th></tr><tr><td>Total liabilities</td><td>79,272</td><td>78,876</td><td>84,236</td><td>84,819</td><td>91,748</td><td>87,326</td><td>92,601</